<Learn
  path="/learn/dubai-ai-seal-explained/"
  lede="The Dubai AI Seal is a free classification from the Dubai Centre for Artificial Intelligence for companies in Dubai that provide AI products or services. It ranks them in six tiers, from E up to S, and Dubai government buyers look for it when they hire AI suppliers. It is not a certificate for businesses that only use AI, but if you buy AI it tells you which suppliers have been checked."
